of debugging version show a message.

1269: /*
1270:  *    Now, select a monster at random.
1271:  */
1272:    ct = rnd(rndmonst_state.choice_count);

ct is set to a random value on the range 1..sum of the frequences.

rnd(x) returns a random number in the range 1..x.

1273:    for (mndx = LOW_PM; mndx < SPECIAL_PM; mndx++)

Loop through the monster type frequences starting from the lowest 
monster type and loop until the special monster type entries start.

1274:       if ((ct -= (int)rndmonst_state.mchoices[mndx]) <= 0) break;
1275:

Subtract the frequency of the current monster type from ct and if this 
brought ct to non-positive abort the loop early

